	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "n1s0VWn4X_wtK9ASN",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 13, DX 12, IQ 4, HT 14, HP 13, WILL 9, PER 9, FP 14, SPEED 6.5, MOVE 6, DODGE 9, DR 1. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "nGeg2I_Jy-Rdn57WW",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 23 (offense 12, protection 11), threat tier minor, appearing 1."
		},
		{
			"id": "nevp7O2IN7GcTQX8o",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/wolverine.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nibxUVnhbL8bXO_TK",
			"text": "Independent build total: 1 points of racial traits plus 12 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "nutJRLDZCQO_y0Wlf",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Wolverine (SRD 3.5). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "n6iADt7FXZRcpbpDs",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nfwQDGeuIh_r3PSCc",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 6 (primary). The published Move folds this creature's Enhanced Move into a single figure."
		},
		{
			"id": "n7kX64OlMCID-NO-s",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
